```

创建数据库
```
  curl -X POST 'http://{host}:{port}/api/v3/horizon/v1/table/public-database/create' \
    -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
    -H 'api-key: api_key' \
    -H 'sensorsdata-project: default' \
    -d '{
    "project_id": 1,
    "database": {
      "name": "test_db",
      "created_by": "test"
    }
  }'
  返回值示例：
  {
    "code": "SUCCESS",
    "request_id": "121604079d9834d9a4011cb2b1fe588d",
    "data": {
        "workspace": "PUBLIC",
        "project_id": 1,
        "name": "test_db",
        "created_by": "test"
    }
  }
```
